        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakalanga pele katakwe sikugwasya, ndakagamba pele katakwe sikunditabilila, elyo kuboko kwangu ndemwini kwakandifutula, abukali bwangu mbobwakandiiabilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
