        },
        {
          "text": "Mumapenzi aabo oonse wakapenga alakwe, aangelo wakwe nguwakabafutula, Muluyando lwakwe amukweetela kwakwe wakabanununa. Wakababweza akubabbala mazuba oonse aakale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
