        },
        {
          "text": "Pele bakapapila akupenzya Muuya wakwe uusalala, Nkaambo kako wakasanduka, waba sinkondonyina wabo, wabalwisya mwini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lumwi wakaibalukwa mazuba aakale, makani aa-Musa abantu bakwe. Uli kuli oyo iwakabapozya mulwizi antoomwe amweembeli wambelele zyakwe? Uli kuli oyo iwakabika Muuya wakwe uusalala mukati kabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uli kuli oyo iwakeenda akuboko kwakwe kwabulemu kujanza lyalulyo lya-Musa, oyo iwakakosola maanzi kubusyu bwabo, kutu alijanine impuwo iitamani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akubeenzya akati kamaanzi malamfu aalwizi? Bakeenda kabotu mbuli ibbiza munkanda, teebakalifumpula pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbuli iŋombe ziya mukuti, Muuya wa-Jehova wakabakatalusya, Mbuboobo mbowakeenzya bantu bako, kuti ulijanine izina lyabulemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
