              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sondela kuzwa kujulu, langa kuzwa kucikalilo cako cisalala cabulemu. Buli kuli busungu bwako anguzu zyako? Luyando lwamoyo wako aluzyalo lwako, zyoonse ndazinyanzigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
